for all 
\begin_inset Formula $i$
\end_inset

, given 
\begin_inset Formula $a_{0}^{i}$
\end_inset

 and the pricing kernel, the decision rules solve the household's problem;
\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate
for all realizations of 
\begin_inset Formula $\left\{ s_{t}\right\} _{t=0}^{\infty}$
\end_inset

, the consumption and asset portfolios 
